7.3 Agent Enrollment & Lifecycle (UC-02)
• Admin form: identity, branch, escrow reference, IMEI — duplicate IMEI is rejected inline.
• Suspend action invalidates all active sessions immediately; deletion is blocked while sessions are open or a
variance_debt is unresolved (FR-02).
7.4 Branch Working-Hours Configuration (UC-15)
• Simple open/close/grace time picker per branch, with a history log of prior schedule changes retained for audit.
7.5 Mapping & Field Tracking Module (UC-11, UC-13)
• Full-screen Mapbox/Leaflet component.
◦ Route trace: polyline connecting the day's location_ping records.
◦ Transaction markers: clickable points opening the digital receipt.
◦ Geofencing: translucent polygon per assigned geofence; a ping outside the polygon turns the route line
red instantly and raises an entry in the notifications panel (geofence_alert).
7.6 OFJ & Variance Oversight
• Branch-scoped table of open/closed OFJ sessions, outstanding variance_debt, and export ack_status — mirrors
the mobile OFJ data but read/oversight-only from this surface.
