12. Asset Export Specification
• Icons: single SVG source per icon, exported at 24×24 and 32×32 for mobile (@1x/2x/3x raster fallback),
20×20/24×24 for web; stroke-based, 2 px stroke weight, consistent corner radius with the design-token radius
scale.
• Illustrations (empty states, onboarding): SVG, optimized (<15 KB), no embedded raster unless photographic
(client profile photo placeholder).
• Naming convention: icon/{name}/{size}, illustration/{context}/{name} — matches component/token naming
so engineering can map 1:1 without a lookup table.
• Map assets (geofence polygons, markers): exported as GeoJSON, not images, to stay editable in the
Mapbox/Leaflet layer.
